{{PageBanner|Clb l 004 3 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the line strategy RPG game known as '''Merc Storia''' (メルクストーリア, ''Meruku Sutōria'', '''Merc Storia''') was held originally held from June 17th, 2014 to June 30th, 2014. The collaboration includes an [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during the collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by [https://www.happyelements.co.jp/ Happy Elements K.K].

==Event Information==
The Battle Cats cross paths with the heroes of {{Color|#C9372C|'''Merc Storia'''}} for a special crossover event, available {{Color|#C9372C|'''between April 14th (11:00am) and April 28th, 2025 (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
This edition features reset clear rewards for certain stages, and new Uber Rare heroes added to the Rare Capsules!

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Merc Storia Limited Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
For a limited time, collect limited collab units from Merc Storia in the Rare Capsule Machine!<br>
Check out NEW Uber Rare character {{Color|#216E4E|'''Taitenki'''}} and {{Color|#AE2E24|'''a new True Form'''}} for {{Color|#2898BD|'''Nono'''}}! Plus, {{Color|#AE2E24|'''new Talents are unlocked'''}} for {{Color|#1558BC|'''Eyewaltz'''}} and {{Color|#AF59E1|'''Mystica'''}}!<br>
The characters available only in this limited edition collab capsule set include<br>
{{Color|#22A06B|'''Taitenki (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Long-range Area attacks Strong against Aliens and Aku!<br>
{{Color|#357DE8|'''Eyewaltz (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
100% Survives one Lethal Attack! Area attacks have a chance of Savage Blow.<br>
{{Color|#803FA5|'''Todomeki (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Area attacks might Slow Aliens & Zombies!<br>
{{Color|#FCA700|'''Michelia (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Strong vs Floating with a chance for Area Attacks to Freeze!<br>
{{Color|#2898BD|'''Hearscht (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Might Critical Attack, Tough vs Metal!<br>
{{Color|#C9372C|'''Cornelia (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Area attacks might Freeze Red & Black!<br>
{{Color|#1558BC|'''Juvens (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Tough vs Angel enemies!<br>
{{Color|#AF59E1|'''Mystica (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Long-range Area attacks, plus Strong vs Black.<br>
{{Color|#E06C00|'''Wyvern (Uber Rare)'''}}<br>
Massive Area damage vs Black enemies!

PLUS<br>
{{Color|#357DE8|'''Super Rare Units: Orthos, Citrouille, Alois, Rei, Aura'''}}<br>
{{Color|#22A06B|'''Rare Units: Celesse, Nono, Olga, Norn, Yoichi, Serum, Fuu'''}}

※Please note that draws from the Merc Storia rare capsule set may provide regularly appearing rare Cat units. Merc Storia collab units will not be available from other scheduled Rare Capsule sets appearing during the collaboration.<br>
※If Merc Storia content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Collab Stages in Legend Stories!'''}}<br>
The Healer and his allies are waiting for you to challenge them! Face down Merc Storia characters as tough foes in these special maps!<br>
Also, {{Color|#C9372C|'''stage clear rewards are reset for certain stages!'''}}

{{Color|#E06C00|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Showdown!"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#E06C00|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Inferno"'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages and select these maps from the Collab Stages section. Clearing any stage will give you a small change to unlock the limited collab character {{Color|#C9372C|'''Healer'''}}, but more difficult stages have a higher drop rate! (Or, use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to unlock the character upon stage clear.)

※ After unlocking Healer, activate the character by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu!

{{Color|#E06C00|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Attack"'''}}<br>
Get tons of XP when you clear this stage!<br>
{{Color|#E06C00|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Mystery"'''}}<br>
Get a chance to unlock a limited edition collab unit when you clear this stage!<br>
Both stages will be available {{Color|#C9372C|'''starting from Day 6 (April 19, 2025)'''}} of the collab!

Earn bigger and better rewards based on your Timed Score after clearing the stage. <br>
{{Color|#C9372C|'''The two stages above have had their rewards reset'''}}, so if you have cleared them in a previous event, now is your chance to reclaim their rewards afte clearing them!

※ Tap the Timed Score button on the map menu to see a list of available prizes.

{{Color|#C9372C|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Healer Awakens"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#C9372C|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Merc Awakens"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#C9372C|'''・Collab Map: "Merc Storia: Titi Awakens"'''}}<br>
Clear the stages for a chance to {{Color|#C9372C|'''unlock the True Form evolution'''}} of {{Color|#C9372C|'''Healer'''}}, {{Color|#C9372C|'''Merc'''}} and {{Color|#C9372C|'''Titi'''}}!

※ Characters may be upgraded to their True Form after reaching Level 20.<br>
※ If "Merc Storia: Mystery" is cleared before the character is collected, it is possible that you may unlock the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.<br>
※ If Merc Storia content does not appear in your version of The Battle Cats, please update to the most recent version of the app.

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Event: Trials of Merc Storia!'''}}<br>
Only during this Merc Storia collab event, a new gauntlet series map appears!<br>
Visit the Event/Legend Stages in Battle Cats to take on this expert-level challenge! Each stage is tougher than the last, with even more rewards for each you clear!<br>
Can you make it all the way to the 20th level and emerge victorious from Healer & company's final challenge?

※Available after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Ranking Stage "Weak of Spirit" at the Catclaw Dojo!'''}}<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event {{Color|#C9372C|'''Weak of Spirit'''}} and {{Color|#C9372C|'''pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans'''}} as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Clear the stage, get a high score and earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!<br>
Check the possible roads by tapping the Rewards List button at top right of the Dojo menu.<br>
{{Color|#C9372C|'''Fight off Healer and his Merc Storia allies as fast as you can to earn a place in the top 1% of the Dojo Rankings!'''}}

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. <br>
※ Rewards delivered to your Mailbox will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Events'''}}<br>
Call on the friendly monster ally Toto to help Gamatoto on his adventures and unearth even more prizes! Plus, only during this Merc Storia collab event, send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited area {{Color|#C9372C|'''Mystery Spring'''}} for a ton of extra XP!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Collab Missions at the Catclaw Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Merc Storia stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!

※Mission rewards cannot claimed after the end of the collab event even if their clear conditions are met.

{{Color|#E06C00|'''● Login Stamp Rewards each day!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base menu during this campaign, you will pick up another login stamp! More login stamps will get you bigger and better prizes, including {{Color|#C9372C|'''Special collab Unit "Merc" on Day 5'''}} and {{Color|#C9372C|'''Special collab Unit "Titi" on Day 10'''}}.

Play the Battle Cats every day and don't miss a single prize!

※ After unlocking Titi or Merc, activate the character by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu!<br>
※"Titi" and "Merc" units received from previous collab events cannot be collected again.

